            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"reactive-related-data-analysis\">Reactive Related Data Analysis</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Explore related business data interactively.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The data has two one-to-many relationships:</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>region \u2192 store \u2192 employee</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Analysis:</strong> Calculate the average number of employees\nper store in each region.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">SQL joins the related tables and calculates the\naverage employees per store.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The SQL query result is returned as a pandas DataFrame,\nand Python visualizes the results.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">| <a href=\"https://github.com/denisecase/datafun-05-sql/blob/main/src/datafun/notebook.py\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Project Source</a>\n| <a href=\"https://denisecase.github.io/datafun-05-sql/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Project Docs</a></span>\n<hr /></span>"
